NRSDUwUkZscmNMVg?oc=5","date":"2026-10-30","zh":"阿布達比與 MakeMyTrip 提供免簽證住宿優惠"},{"title":"Appeals court suspends the order requiring the reopening of the 2027 Visa Lottery","src":"CiberCuba","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxOVHA5M0ZUT2xReEFsQ211d2ZyN0lOdEdzV0RKRFBhd1lLQmFkSVZHUWd4S01GV2VCT0tOQThHeGhOZG0xNDRUaW4wMmpwN3dHUUFpa1pKZnBkdTROd2txNEk5RFpJc0RsbGx6UEpPT0pxa2lFZnY2bHlJN3A5RlZ0LUNHMjk0RnkxN2I4MmZlTnVwLTlsWlZBQ28zZ01SWlVoYmw3b1dIQ2RwREtKcXgyTU5lelE4REdVY050b0NTbG4tYWM?oc=5","date":"2026-10-30","zh":"上訴法院暫停要求重新開放 2027 年簽證抽籤的命令"},{"title":"PGA Tour, Visa reportedly on verge of massive sponsorship agreement","src":"Golf Channel","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxNYmNuMTB3WTNyb2ZrS2VuNzdTdmhhQUhnQnFIQWhJNmdibmZXMkNNUTd2ZEhhMHFhbWYyMzVGb0JfaDhkRlZVOWE1YW5DaVVDemFjM3VtS0NqNDJCNTJiRGJTSHZWLUZRbkdmOXlLdF9JRzhkS0psZWNTVjhiR2stUkJETXQ0eVFpZkZGSEs1a0t5NTZ5ak5NcmIzQTZqRUFOX2cwZTBBajVsemtQ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"據報道美巡賽與 Visa 即將達成大規模贊助協議"},{"title":"PGA Tour closing in on eight-figure Visa sponsorship, report says","src":"Golfweek","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxNR0p1Vmp2SUxmUDNiQUtNU3JGcERCSnFvbF9ITHpOSkJlVlBla0tWUFI2N1o1eldzWEMtS3NVVGdZZXBYcDdPSTBwb0dLSnRLX1l5QU5OdjlHbEVDMTlJTjliVFhOeWFzcTNoeFhYbEJZcnJEY1h4MFFwOEVZWVVndU12OTZqT1dsb1J2SkpnNXZhWHBUZkZrZjdGMGJEMEhlM1dEcWlXSW9nY05hQmlTaFpfZw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"報導稱美巡賽即將獲得八位數的 Visa 贊助"}],"themes":[{"name":"訂單/合約","count":5},{"name":"財報","count":3},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2025-11-06","period":"2025-09-30","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1403161/000140316125000089/v-20250930.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Visa is one of the world's leaders in digital payments. Our purpose is to uplift everyone, everywhere by being the best way to pay and be paid. Since Visa's early days in 1958, we have been in the business of facilitating secure, reliable and efficient global commerce and money movement. We provide transaction processing services (primarily authorization, clearing and settlement) among consumers, issuing and acquiring financial institutions and sellers in a structure we call the \"four-party\" model. Please see Our Core Business discussion below. As the payments ecosystem continues to evolve, we have broadened this model to include digital banks, digital wallets, a range of financial technology companies (fintechs), governments and non-governmental organizations (NGOs). We are focused on extending, enhancing and investing in our proprietary advanced transaction processing network, VisaNet,","zh":"Visa 是全球數位支付領域的領導者之一。我們的目標是透過提供最佳的付款和收款方式來提升世界各地的每個人的生活水平。自 Visa 1958 年成立之初以來，我們一直致力於促進安全、可靠和高效的全球商業和資金流動。我們以我們稱為「四方」模式的結構在消費者、發行和收單金融機構以及賣家之間提供交易處理服務（主要是授權、清算和結算）。請參閱下面我們的核心業務討論。隨著支付生態系統的不斷發展，我們擴大了這個模式，將數位銀行、數位錢包、一系列金融科技公司 (fintech)、政府和非政府組織 (NGO) 納入其中。我們專注於擴展、增強和投資我們專有的先進交易處理網路 VisaNet、"},{"en":"We offer a wide range of Visa-branded payment products that our clients, including nearly 14,500 financial institutions, use to develop and offer payment solutions or services, including credit, debit, prepaid and cash access programs for individual, business and government account holders. During fiscal 2025, Visa's total payments and cash volume was $17 trillion, and we had nearly 5 billion payment credentials, which are issued Visa card accounts, that were available to be used at more than 175 million merchant locations worldwide.(1)","zh":"我們提供廣泛的 Visa 品牌支付產品，包括近 14,500 家金融機構在內的客戶使用這些產品來開發和提供支付解決方案或服務，包括個人、企業和政府帳戶持有人的信用卡、金融卡、預付和現金存取計畫。 2025 財年，Visa 的支付總額和現金量為 17 兆美元，我們擁有近 50 億個支付憑證，這些憑證是 Visa 卡帳戶，可在全球超過 1.75 億個商家網點使用。 (1)"},{"en":"We take an open partnership approach and seek to provide value by enabling access to our global network through multiple integration methods, including programmatic access via application programming interfaces (APIs) and structured data exchange through our Model Context Protocol (MCP) server. We partner with traditional financial institutions and emerging fintech and AI companies to innovate and expand the payments ecosystem, enabling them to leverage our platform infrastructure to accelerate their business growth and market expansion.","zh":"我們採取開放的合作夥伴方式，並尋求透過多種整合方法存取我們的全球網路，包括透過應用程式介面 (API) 進行程式存取以及透過我們的模型上下文協議 (MCP) 伺服器進行結構化資料交換，從而提供價值。我們與傳統金融機構以及新興金融科技和人工智慧公司合作，創新和擴展支付生態系統，使他們能夠利用我們的平台基礎設施加速業務成長和市場擴張。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Even with our strong foundation in credit, significant opportunity remains in international markets, where the penetration of card-linked credit products as a percentage of consumer spending is less than half that of the U.S. To address this, we continue to develop new products that provide greater control and insight to our issuing clients and their customers. For example, Visa Flex Credential allows consumers to use a single Visa payment credential to access and switch between multiple funding sources, like debit and credit. As of September 30, 2025, we have more than 20 signed clients in more than 20 countries across all regions.","zh":"即使我們擁有強大的信貸基礎，國際市場仍然存在重大機會，而卡關聯信貸產品在消費者支出中的滲透率還不到美國的一半。為了解決這個問題，我們繼續開發新產品，為我們的發卡客戶及其客戶提供更好的控制和洞察力。例如，Visa Flex Credential 允許消費者使用單一 Visa 支付憑證來存取和切換多種資金來源，例如金融卡和信用卡。截至2025年9月30日，我們在各地區20多個國家擁有20多家簽約客戶。"}],"competition":[{"en":"The global payments industry continues to undergo dynamic and rapid change. Existing and emerging competitors compete with Visa's network and payment solutions for consumers and for participation by financial institutions and sellers. Technology and innovation are shifting consumer habits and driving growth opportunities in ecommerce, GenAI agent-based commerce, mobile payments, blockchain technology and digital currencies, including stablecoins. These advances are enabling new entrants, many of which depart from traditional network payment models. In certain countries, the evolving regulatory landscape is creating local networks or enabling additional processing competition.","zh":"全球支付產業持續經歷動態和快速的變化。現有和新興的競爭對手都在與 Visa 的網路和支付解決方案競爭，以吸引消費者以及金融機構和賣家的參與。技術和創新正在改變消費者習慣，並推動電子商務、基於 GenAI 代理的商務、行動支付、區塊鏈技術和數位貨幣（包括穩定幣）的成長機會。這些進步正在催生新的進入者，其中許多都背離了傳統的網路支付模式。在某些國家，不斷變化的監管環境正在創建本地網路或促成額外的處理競爭。"},{"en":"We compete against all forms of payment. These include paper-based payments, primarily cash and checks, and all forms of electronic payments. Our electronic payment competitors principally include the ones listed below.","zh":"我們與所有形式的支付方式競爭。其中包括紙本支付（主要是現金和支票）以及所有形式的電子支付。我們的電子支付競爭對手主要包括以下所列。"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-09-30","items":[{"name":"Data Processing Revenues","val":19993000000,"zh":"數據處理收入"},{"name":"Service","val":17539000000,"zh":"服務"},{"name":"International Transaction Revenues","val":14166000000,"zh":"國際交易收入"},{"name":"Value Added Services","val":10900000000,"zh":"加值服務"},{"name":"Service Other","val":4053000000,"zh":"服務其他"}],"total":40000000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-09-30","items":[{"name":"Non Us","val":24367000000,"zh":"非我們"},{"name":"US","val":15633000000,"zh":"美國"}],"total":40000000000}},"peers":["MA","PYPL","AXP","COST","JPM"]}}